# role-frontend — a thin COMPOSITE bundle for frontend/web work (FETCHED-ONLINE,
# never baked). The engine has no `#meta:requires` directive, so a role bundle
# composes by listing the primitives' members directly (pacman --needed dedupes
# if a member is already present from another pack). KEEP THIS SMALL — it
# references the primitives, it does not invent new tooling.
#
# Source packs it mirrors:
#   • lang-node  → pnpm, yarn, mise:node@lts   (the primary frontend runtime)
#   • dev-cli    → httpie, xh, mkcert          (API + local-TLS dev essentials)
# A few curated members, not the whole of each primitive, so the bundle stays a
# fast-start frontend kit rather than a kitchen sink.
#meta:type role
pnpm
yarn
httpie
xh
mkcert

# Primary frontend runtime — mise-managed Node LTS (same directive as lang-node).
mise:node@lts
